      <p style="text-indent: 5em" rend="first-line-indent(5)" source="#source-590-639"><g ref="#gaiji-1-3-27" source="#source-605-635">◉</g></p>
      <p source="#source-639-677"><seg source="#source-639-677">秋の木の葉がふるひ出す、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-677-724"><seg source="#source-677-698">ものにおびへた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-698-710"><rb>眼</rb><rt>め</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-710-724">の色は、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-724-777"><seg source="#source-724-730">たゞ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-730-745"><rb>白</rb><rt>しろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-745-777">びかり――何を見る。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-777-824"><seg source="#source-777-783">ひら</seg><choice source="#source-783-789"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-789-792">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-792-810"><rb>黄葉</rb><rt>きは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-810-824">がちる、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-824-880"><seg source="#source-824-848">彼れは何処へ？　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-848-872"><rb>真暗</rb><rt>まつくら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-872-880">な、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-880-959"><seg source="#source-880-886">谷へ</seg><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-886-928" corresp="#source-895-928"><seg source="#source-886-895">ほこら</seg></hi><seg source="#source-928-959">へ――あな消へた。</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 5em" rend="first-line-indent(5)" source="#source-959-1008"><g ref="#gaiji-1-3-27" source="#source-974-1004">◉</g></p>
      <p source="#source-1008-1052"><seg source="#source-1008-1023">暗い森から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1023-1038"><rb>鳥</rb><rt>とり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1038-1052">が啼く、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1052-1140"><seg source="#source-1052-1058">あな</seg><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-1058-1106" corresp="#source-1070-1106"><seg source="#source-1058-1064">ほろ</seg><choice source="#source-1064-1070"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></hi><seg source="#source-1106-1140">と、そこなりに………</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1140-1193"><seg source="#source-1140-1164">ある触るる音よ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1164-1179"><rb>暮</rb><rt>くる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1179-1193">るる日の</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1193-1240"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1193-1208"><rb>天</rb><rt>そら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1208-1240">と人とのなかを過ぐ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1240-1281"><seg source="#source-1240-1281">食ひのこしたるパンの切れ、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1281-1354"><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-1281-1323" corresp="#source-1290-1323"><seg source="#source-1281-1290">ぢつと</seg></hi><seg source="#source-1323-1354">みつめば、涙ぐむ。</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 5em" rend="first-line-indent(5)" source="#source-1354-1403"><g ref="#gaiji-1-3-27" source="#source-1369-1399">◉</g></p>
      <p source="#source-1403-1459"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1403-1424"><rb>白髪</rb><rt>しらが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1424-1433">頭のお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1433-1448"><rb>爺</rb><rt>ぢい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1448-1459">さん、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1459-1506"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1459-1474"><rb>曲</rb><rt>まが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1474-1506">つた腰もかまはずに、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1506-1553"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1506-1527"><rb>物識</rb><rt>ものし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1527-1553">り顔に世を渡る。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1553-1588"><seg source="#source-1553-1588">前にあるのは何かいな、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1588-1641"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1588-1603"><rb>後</rb><rt>うし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1603-1641">ろにゐるのは誰れかいな、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1641-1688"><seg source="#source-1641-1650">静かに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1650-1668"><rb>眼</rb><rt>まなこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1668-1688">ひらき見よ！</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1688-1720"><seg source="#source-1688-1720">前にあるのは白き家、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1720-1755"><seg source="#source-1720-1755">後ろにあるは、黒き影、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1755-1798"><seg source="#source-1755-1798">なかのお爺さんそを知らぬ。</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 5em" rend="first-line-indent(5)" source="#source-1798-1847"><g ref="#gaiji-1-3-27" source="#source-1813-1843">◉</g></p>
      <p source="#source-1847-1903"><seg source="#source-1847-1865">空が焼けた、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1865-1886"><rb>真紅</rb><rt>まつか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1886-1903">にやけた！</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1903-1962"><seg source="#source-1903-1918">悪しき獣を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1918-1933"><rb>屠</rb><rt>はふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1933-1962">つたやうに………。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1962-2054"><seg source="#source-1962-1974">空の自然</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-1977-2025"><seg source="#source-1974-1977">□</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-1998-2010">（不明）</seg></note></seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2025-2043"><rb>鏡</rb><rt>レンズ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2043-2054">なら、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-2054-2098"><seg source="#source-2054-2066">人間道　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2066-2087"><rb>悲惨</rb><rt>みぢめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2087-2098">な心、</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-2098-2188"><seg source="#source-2098-2104">写し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-2104-2119"><rb>出</rb><rt>いだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-2119-2131">した地獄</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-2134-2182"><seg source="#source-2131-2134">□</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-2155-2167">（不明）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-2182-2188">か？</seg></p>
    </body>
